            ? "Explore precision-tailored clinical apparel for female healthcare professionals. Fluid drape antimicrobial fabrics, contour seams, and performance weaves. Select a product category below to view designs."
            : "Explore clinical scrubs and uniforms engineered for male healthcare professionals. Athletic 4-way stretch twill, executive mandarin collars, and aerocool weaves. Select a product category below to view designs.";
        }

